  "description": "The Reid City 3 boasts a bike range of well thought-out features, setting it apart from the competition at this price. It includes custom hydroformed aluminium tubing, internal headset for improved longevity and sealed bearing bottom bracket. Also, this Reid City has bottle and rack mounts to turn this into a great bike to explore further afield on. The durable 700C wheelset offers a larger rolling diameter to help each pedal stroke make you go further, and roll over small obstacles whether a nasty pot hole on your commute or tree root on a trail.\nWith powerful brakes, a huge range of gears, wide riser handlebars and mounts for both mudguards and a pannier rack, this city commuter bike is ready for commuting, touring and all-day adventures on roads, bike paths and sealed trails.\nThe lightweight alloy frame and 27-speed Shimano gearing make commute a breeze. Coupled with a premium suspension fork and powerful mechanical discs, you can also have a blast off road on light trails at the weekends.",
